   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· cblist 里的回调被分配 GP 号，并入 NEXT_READY / WAIT 段\n· rdp / rnp->gp_seq_needed：已请求到的最大 GP 号\n· rcu_state.gp_flags |= RCU_GP_FLAG_INIT：叫 GP kthread 开工",
   "originalText": "· cblist 里的回调被分配 GP 号，并入 NEXT_READY / WAIT 段\n· rdp / rnp->gp_seq_needed：已请求到的最大 GP 号\n· rcu_state.gp_flags |= RCU_GP_FLAG_INIT：叫 GP kthread 开工",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
