   "versionNonce": 7472,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· rcu_state.gp_seq：低 2 位 0 → 1（机制 2）\n· rnp->qsmask = rnp->qsmaskinit；rnp->gp_seq = 新号\n· rcu_state.jiffies_stall：本轮 stall 期限（机制 9）\n· rcu_state.gp_state：RCU_GP_ONOFF → RCU_GP_INIT",
   "originalText": "· rcu_state.gp_seq：低 2 位 0 → 1（机制 2）\n· rnp->qsmask = rnp->qsmaskinit；rnp->gp_seq = 新号\n· rcu_state.jiffies_stall：本轮 stall 期限（机制 9）\n· rcu_state.gp_state：RCU_GP_ONOFF → RCU_GP_INIT",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
