   "seed": 1069,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7486,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 遍历期间已下线的 CPU：用 rcu_gp_init_mask 替它们直接报 QS\n· 上一轮遗留的被抢占读者不能算进本轮：\n  rcu_preempt_check_blocked_tasks()\n· 每处理一个节点就 cond_resched：GP kthread 自己也不能霸占 CPU",
   "originalText": "· 遍历期间已下线的 CPU：用 rcu_gp_init_mask 替它们直接报 QS\n· 上一轮遗留的被抢占读者不能算进本轮：\n  rcu_preempt_check_blocked_tasks()\n· 每处理一个节点就 cond_resched：GP kthread 自己也不能霸占 CPU",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "lU3zTESH",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2340,
   "y": 620,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 170,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
