  {
   "id": "hJmIH4nn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2354,
   "y": 822,
   "width": 604.7999999999994,
   "height": 87.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0073",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1073,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7514,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· rdp->cpu_no_qs.b.norm：本 CPU 本轮还没经过 QS（rcu_qs() 清掉它）\n· rdp->core_needs_qs：本轮 GP 在等本 CPU\n· rnp->qsmask：逐位清零；节点清零后清父节点里自己的位\n· rnp->gp_tasks：挡住本轮 GP 的被抢占读者（机制 5）\n· rdp->watching_snap / rcu_urgent_qs / rcu_need_heavy_qs：FQS 用（机制 4）",
   "originalText": "· rdp->cpu_no_qs.b.norm：本 CPU 本轮还没经过 QS（rcu_qs() 清掉它）\n· rdp->core_needs_qs：本轮 GP 在等本 CPU\n· rnp->qsmask：逐位清零；节点清零后清父节点里自己的位\n· rnp->gp_tasks：挡住本轮 GP 的被抢占读者（机制 5）\n· rdp->watching_snap / rcu_urgent_qs / rcu_need_heavy_qs：FQS 用（机制 4）",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "UKqZAdh5",
