   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "要解决什么",
   "originalText": "要解决什么",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "neIUs0w3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 16.0,
   "y": 2998,
   "width": 570.0,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0364",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1364,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 9551,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 登记要极便宜：call_rcu() 可能在任何上下文、以极高的频率调用\n· 每个回调要等的 GP 不一样（登记时刻不同），但不能给每个回调单独记 GP 号、\n  GP 结束时再逐个检查\n· GP 结束后要马上找出所有到期的回调\n· 执行时不能长时间霸占 softirq；回调洪峰时又要尽快消化掉",
   "originalText": "· 登记要极便宜：call_rcu() 可能在任何上下文、以极高的频率调用\n· 每个回调要等的 GP 不一样（登记时刻不同），但不能给每个回调单独记 GP 号、\n  GP 结束时再逐个检查\n· GP 结束后要马上找出所有到期的回调\n· 执行时不能长时间霸占 softirq；回调洪峰时又要尽快消化掉",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "YWTnMLXK",
