   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "关键约束：回调要等\"登记之后才开始\"的 GP",
   "originalText": "关键约束：回调要等\"登记之后才开始\"的 GP",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "iOKHA5tG",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3202.6666666666665,
   "y": 2998,
   "width": 468.0,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0370",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1370,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 9593,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "GP N 只保证等到\"它开始之前就进入\"的读者。\n如果回调登记时 GP N 已经在进行，可能有读者在 GP N 开始之后、\n更新发布之前拿到了旧指针 —— GP N 不会等它们。\n所以这个回调必须等 GP N+1。\nrcu_seq_snap() 算的就是这个号（机制 2）。",
   "originalText": "GP N 只保证等到\"它开始之前就进入\"的读者。\n如果回调登记时 GP N 已经在进行，可能有读者在 GP N 开始之后、\n更新发布之前拿到了旧指针 —— GP N 不会等它们。\n所以这个回调必须等 GP N+1。\nrcu_seq_snap() 算的就是这个号（机制 2）。",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "eF181OmF",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3164,
   "width": 80,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
