   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 10006,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "单个回调的状态机：状态 = 它在哪一段；箭头上是谁、在什么条件下把它挪过去",
