  {
   "id": "5fvRU9T0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2406.0,
   "y": 5423,
   "width": 690.0,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0561",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1561,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 10930,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 发现只清一个 per-CPU 标志：rcu_qs() 把 cpu_no_qs.b.norm 置 0，几乎零成本\n· 上报留到 rcu_core 里做：拿 leaf 的锁清位；节点清零后才去碰父节点 → 争抢被分散到各节点\n· 每次上报都核对 GP 号，对不上就作废、重新欠 QS",
   "originalText": "· 发现只清一个 per-CPU 标志：rcu_qs() 把 cpu_no_qs.b.norm 置 0，几乎零成本\n· 上报留到 rcu_core 里做：拿 leaf 的锁清位；节点清零后才去碰父节点 → 争抢被分散到各节点\n· 每次上报都核对 GP 号，对不上就作废、重新欠 QS",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
