  {
   "id": "k9oJvcr0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2160,
   "y": 6242,
   "width": 533.0000000000003,
   "height": 48.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0637",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1637,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11462,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "① CPU6 持 leaf 1 的锁清掉自己的位 → leaf 1 变 0\n② 放下 leaf 1 的锁，拿 root 的锁，清掉 leaf 1 在 root 里的位 → root 变 0\n③ root 清零 → rcu_report_qs_rsp()：设 RCU_GP_FLAG_FQS，唤醒 GP kthread",
   "originalText": "① CPU6 持 leaf 1 的锁清掉自己的位 → leaf 1 变 0\n② 放下 leaf 1 的锁，拿 root 的锁，清掉 leaf 1 在 root 里的位 → root 变 0\n③ root 清零 → rcu_report_qs_rsp()：设 RCU_GP_FLAG_FQS，唤醒 GP kthread",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "6xb7YSTt",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 3200,
   "y": 5912,
   "width": 1540,
   "height": 300,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
