   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "要解决什么",
   "originalText": "要解决什么",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "489JrXQ4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 16.0,
   "y": 6508,
   "width": 651.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0644",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1644,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11511,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 在 idle / 用户态 / guest 里的 CPU 肯定不在读侧，但它不执行内核代码，没法自己上报\n· nohz_full CPU 连 tick 都没有\n· 为了报 QS 去唤醒它们，会破坏省电和低延迟\n· 还有一类 CPU 在内核里跑着却迟迟不报（长循环、关抢占），需要有人催",
   "originalText": "· 在 idle / 用户态 / guest 里的 CPU 肯定不在读侧，但它不执行内核代码，没法自己上报\n· nohz_full CPU 连 tick 都没有\n· 为了报 QS 去唤醒它们，会破坏省电和低延迟\n· 还有一类 CPU 在内核里跑着却迟迟不报（长循环、关抢占），需要有人催",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "LxTqcMSl",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2390.0,
   "y": 6466,
