   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "怎么设计",
   "originalText": "怎么设计",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "wCmF9HmK",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2406.0,
   "y": 6508,
   "width": 750.0,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0647",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1647,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11532,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 这些 CPU 进出 EQS 时只改一个本 CPU 计数（入口代码本来就要执行，几乎零成本）\n· GP kthread 定时远程读这个计数：此刻在 EQS，或从上次快照之后变过 → 说明经过了 EQS → 替它上报\n· 对既不在 EQS、又迟迟不报的 CPU：按 GP 已进行的时间逐级加大催促力度",
   "originalText": "· 这些 CPU 进出 EQS 时只改一个本 CPU 计数（入口代码本来就要执行，几乎零成本）\n· GP kthread 定时远程读这个计数：此刻在 EQS，或从上次快照之后变过 → 说明经过了 EQS → 替它上报\n· 对既不在 EQS、又迟迟不报的 CPU：按 GP 已进行的时间逐级加大催促力度",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "Xf7Sqina",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 6636,
   "width": 80,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
