   "versionNonce": 11868,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "要解决什么",
   "originalText": "要解决什么",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "i5c9WpOX",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 16.0,
   "y": 7382,
   "width": 597.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0696",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1696,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11875,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· 可抢占内核里，读者可能在临界区里被抢占 —— 上下文切换不能再当作\"它离开了读侧\"\n· 但不能为此禁止抢占（实时性要求）\n· 读侧快速路径仍要极便宜\n· 低优先级读者被抢占后可能很久拿不到 CPU，把 GP 拖得很长",
   "originalText": "· 可抢占内核里，读者可能在临界区里被抢占 —— 上下文切换不能再当作\"它离开了读侧\"\n· 但不能为此禁止抢占（实时性要求）\n· 读侧快速路径仍要极便宜\n· 低优先级读者被抢占后可能很久拿不到 CPU，把 GP 拖得很长",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
