   "text": "本 CPU 自己还欠 QS → print_cpu_stall()：\"self-detected stall\"\n否则再等 RCU_STALL_RAT_DELAY → print_other_cpu_stall()",
   "originalText": "本 CPU 自己还欠 QS → print_cpu_stall()：\"self-detected stall\"\n否则再等 RCU_STALL_RAT_DELAY → print_other_cpu_stall()",
